{
    "title": "Hay - Live Video Chat & Call",
    "description": "Looking to chat, meet new people, and make friends worldwide in a fun and easy way? Meet Hay, the ultimate social app! With Hay, you can connect via live video or text with people from all walks of life, no matter your location or interests.\r\n\r\nWhat You Get:\r\n- Live video & text chat\r\n- Gender/Region filters\r\n- Fun backgrounds, filters, and effects\r\n- Real-time translation\r\n- Safe community\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a casual chat or hoping to meet someone special, Hay has you covered. Our powerful matching algorithms and customizable filters for gender and location make it easy to find and connect with like-minded individuals. Plus, enjoy beauty filters and real-time translation for engaging conversations with people worldwide!\r\n\r\nHay is also perfect for making like-minded friends. Our intuitive interface lets you quickly chat and build connections based on shared interests like sports, music, movies, and more.\r\n\r\nWhy wait? Download Hay today and start chatting and meeting like never before! Join our friendly community and explore the world in a whole new way.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.hay.fun/terms.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.hay.fun/privacy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking to chat, meet new people, and make friends worldwide in a fun and easy way? Meet Hay, the ultimate social app! With Hay, you can connect via live video or text with people from all walks of life, no matter your location or interests.<br><br>What You Get:<br>- Live video &amp; text chat<br>- Gender/Region filters<br>- Fun backgrounds, filters, and effects<br>- Real-time translation<br>- Safe community<br><br>Whether you&#39;re looking for a casual chat or hoping to meet someone special, Hay has you covered. Our powerful matching algorithms and customizable filters for gender and location make it easy to find and connect with like-minded individuals. Plus, enjoy beauty filters and real-time translation for engaging conversations with people worldwide!<br><br>Hay is also perfect for making like-minded friends. Our intuitive interface lets you quickly chat and build connections based on shared interests like sports, music, movies, and more.<br><br>Why wait? Download Hay today and start chatting and meeting like never before! Join our friendly community and explore the world in a whole new way.<br><br>Terms of Service: https://www.hay.fun/terms.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.hay.fun/privacy.html",
